    "description": "Select one 'Simple Stateless Service' from Category 1 and prepare it for migration. This includes creating a Dockerfile, ensuring it's properly configured for a 12-factor app methodology, and having it ready to be the first service to test the 'Golden CI/CD Pipeline'.",
    "loop_type": "task",
    "priority": 4,
    "source": "Strategist"
  }
}
```
